::  c3: burp (via !>'s !;) of cores whose payload is %noun, a fork or a hint/hold, reaching
::  ty_core's payload type_tag_kind (mod.rs ~12236, ~12831); a local |$ mold whose %made note
::  carries argument wings (note_to_noun/wing_to_noun/limb_to_noun ~13557-13612).
|%
++  duo  |$  [a b]  [p=a q=b]
++  main
  |=  [a=@ f=$@(@ [@ @]) l=(list @) d=(duo @ ?)]
  :*  !>(=>(^*(*) |.(5)))
      !>(=>(f |.(5)))
      !>(=>(l |.(5)))
      !>(d)
      !>(^*((duo @ @)))
  ==
--
